          <p><span class="doc-clause-num">16.2(b)</span> Licensee acknowledges and agrees that integration is expressly limited to hardware bearing the Licensor's registered trademark, and that any attempt to utilize the Licensed Software in conjunction with third party or non-conforming equipment is undertaken entirely at Licensee's own risk, cost, and expense, and Licensor shall bear no liability, financial or otherwise, arising therefrom, including but not limited to any claim for refund, however such claim may be characterized.</p>
