      <div class="prose" style="max-width:none;">
        <p>Upload a Terms of Service, a Privacy Policy, an Employment Agreement, an NDA, a Government Form. The Index evaluates seven weighted categories and returns a Human Score alongside the document's Legal Score.</p>
