        <tr><td>Choice visibility</td><td>15%</td><td>Whether the reader's actual options are findable in under 10 seconds</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Action clarity</td><td>15%</td><td>Whether a reader can state their next required action unprompted</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Accessibility</td><td>10%</td><td>Contrast, font size, screen reader compatibility</td></tr>
